Author: TimLavelle <tim+1@lavelle.bio>
Date:   Sun Aug 30 08:12:18 2026 +1000

    fix(hooks): scope useHeaderNav's Contentful fetch to the active locale

    getEntries() never passed a locale, so header nav content was always
    fetched in the space's master locale regardless of the active
    storefront - flagged by CodeRabbit and left out of scope during the
    promo-image work, now fixed to match the pattern already used in
    pages/experience/index.tsx: read locale from useMultiSite(), fall back
    to CONTENTFUL_FALLBACK_LOCALE, and include it in both the query key and
    the request. Needed a local ContentfulClientApi<undefined> cast since
    useContentfulClient's deliberately loose ContentfulClientApi<any>
    typing collapses the SDK's locale field out of the type when chain
    modifiers are `any`.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CQ6mu8KUHUnUD8YMGrYwjm

